They don't all say the same thing.  There are a few different writings, but
all indicate a secret door with a trap of some sort behind it (usually
teleport or a trap door, but occassionally a level telporter)

As an added bit for those people desperately searching for a scroll of
teleport, There is a good chance of there being one (sometimes 2 or 3)
scrolls of teleport on any given level, but they are hidden in one square
closet-type rooms with no entrance or exit.  Usually the only way to notice
them is to use a potion of detect treasure or a crystal ball.  Then one
well swung pick-axe or carefully aimed wand of digging will get you in and
the scroll is yours.  I've never had a problem with lack of teleport
scrolls in any game I've ever played, and this is part of the reason.
(this also helps id the scroll, since it is only teleport scrolls that you
find in these types of rooms (unless there is more than one scroll (which is
possible, since it is a room, per se))).

